The best monster (IMHO) to genocide with a young character
who has a scroll of genocide which he/she/it doesn't know
whether or not it's cursed is rust monsters...
why?
Because:
a) They're pains in the neck later on, so worth genociding if the
scroll is uncursed.
b)  If the scroll is cursed, you unequip your weapon and bash
em to death with your hands...they do NO damage, so you will
kill them eventually, and at low levels they are worth basically
one level each since they are pretty high level monsters.

